{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without a store, a tracker keeps its records in memory only. A tracker given a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tracker(store:)"},{"type":"text","text":") appends each record to it as the tracker’s worker reaches the record, before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publishing it, and starts its records with the ones the store kept from earlier runs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the store this module ships: a directory of append-only segment files, bounded at 5 MiB unless you pass another "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"byteBound"},{"type":"text","text":". A segment is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted once every record in it is delivered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store keeps only the event types you list in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":", which conform to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable"},{"type":"text","text":":"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CBOR (RFC 8949), each event a map of its properties under their names, written with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and read with a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryDecoder"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":", part of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Traffluent"},{"type":"text","text":") writes the conformance; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" shows one written by hand. Events of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other types are delivered in this run but never written."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each drop is reported on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/dropReports"},{"type":"text","text":" as a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport"},{"type":"text","text":": the oldest segments"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted to stay under the bound, a write that failed, and records recovery couldn’t read or found"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at another "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"schemaVersion"},{"type":"text","text":". A record whose delivery had started when the app ended comes back with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":" set. Call "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":", after the tracker’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flush()"},{"type":"text","text":", as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app moves to the background, so the records written so far survive power loss too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An app on Apple platforms that already keeps a GRDB database can keep its records in a table of it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DatabaseStore"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GRDBPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","    var seats: Int = 1","}","","let store = try SegmentStore(events: [SignedUp.self], directory: directory, byteBound: 1024 * 1024)","let tracker = Tracker(store: store)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: vendor)","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\", seats: 3))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/persistingrecords","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers what the store writes, its bounds and recovery, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/changingevents","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers which changes to an event’s type its stored records can be read through.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/persistence"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"Persistence"}],"externalID":"Persistence","role":"collection","title":"Persistence","symbolKind":"module"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Keep each record on disk until it is delivered, so the records a tracker tracked survive the app ending.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Stores","anchor":"Stores","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","doc:\/\/Persistence\/